PLAN.md line 66: 'That is about 34.5 days, plus 2 if you want P10.'

The synthesis adds:
- 3-5 d (render extras, route 1);
- 3-4 d (capture-processing chain and the check-landscape-objects change, route 2);
- the bake-off (7 d as stated, about 15-25 d as re-sized above);
